Thanks for the info!

I've changed my dispose and now it's no longer crashing
```
protected override void Dispose(bool disposing)
{
    if (Engine.EditorHint)
        return; // Avoid disposing objects while in the editor

    if (disposing)
    {
        GameSocket.DisconnectFromHost();
        GameSocket.Dispose();
    }

    base.Dispose(disposing);
}
```
